msgid "The closed shell CCSD program"
msgstr "闭壳层 CCSD 程序"

msgid "Bibliography:"
msgstr "参考文献："

msgid ""
"All publications resulting from use of this program must acknowledge the "
"above."
msgstr "所有使用本程序产生的出版物必须引用上述文献。"

msgid "The following options may be specified on the command line:"
msgstr "以下选项可在命令行中指定："

msgid "``NOCHECK`` Ignore convergence checks."
msgstr "``NOCHECK`` 忽略收敛性检查。"

msgid "``DIRECT`` Do calculation integral direct."
msgstr "``DIRECT`` 以直接积分方式进行计算。"

msgid "``NOSING`` Do not include singly external configurations."
msgstr "``NOSING`` 不包含单外部组态。"

msgid ""
"``KSFOCK`` Forces the use of the KS Fock operator in the subsequent "
"calculation. This is required for double-hybrid and RPA calculations."
msgstr "``KSFOCK`` 强制在后续计算中使用 KS Fock 算符。这对于双杂化和 RPA 计算是必需的。"

msgid "The convergence thresholds can also be modified using"
msgstr "收敛阈值也可以通过以下方式修改"

msgid ""
"Convergence is reached if the energy change is smaller than *thrden* "
"(default 1.d-6) *and* the square sum of the amplitude changes is smaller "
"than *thrvar* (default (1.d-10). The ``THRESH`` card must follow the command"
" for the method (e.g., ``CCSD``) and then overwrites the corresponding "
"global options (see ``GTHRESH``, sec. `global Thresholds (GTHRESH) "
"<program_control.html#global-thresholds-gthresh>`__)."
msgstr ""
"当能量变化小于 *thrden*\\ （默认 1.d-6）\\ *且* 振幅变化的平方和小于 *thrvar*\\ （默认 "
"1.d-10）时，即达到收敛。\\ ``THRESH`` 卡片必须跟在方法命令（例如 ``CCSD``\\ ）之后，然后会覆盖相应的全局选项（参见 "
"``GTHRESH``\\ ，章节 `全局阈值 (GTHRESH) <program_control.html#global-thresholds-"
"gthresh>`__\\ ）。"

msgid ""
"The computed energies are stored in variables as explained in section "
"`special variables <variables.html#special-variables>`__. As well as the "
"energy, the :math:`T_1` diagnostic (T. J. Lee and P. R. Taylor, Int. J. "
"Quant. Chem. S23 (1989) 199) and the :math:`D_1` diagnostic (C. L. Janssen "
"and I. M. B. Nielsen, Chem. Phys. Lett. 290 (1998), 423, and T. J. Lee. "
"Chem. Phys. Lett. 372 (2003), 362) are printed and stored for later analysis"
" in the variables T1DIAG and D1DIAG, respectively."
msgstr ""
"计算出的能量存储在变量中，如章节 `特殊变量 <variables.html#special-variables>`__ 所述。除了能量之外，\\ "
":math:`T_1` 诊断（T. J. Lee 和 P. R. Taylor, Int. J. Quant. Chem. S23 (1989) "
"199）和 :math:`D_1` 诊断（C. L. Janssen 和 I. M. B. Nielsen, Chem. Phys. Lett. 290"
" (1998), 423，以及 T. J. Lee. Chem. Phys. Lett. 372 (2003), "
"362）也会被打印出来，并分别存储在变量 T1DIAG 和 D1DIAG 中以供后续分析。"

msgid ""
"For geometry optimization and computing first-order properties see section "
"`expectation values <the_closed_shell_ccsd_program.html#expectation-"
"values>`__."
msgstr ""
"关于几何优化和计算一阶性质，请参见章节 `期望值 <the_closed_shell_ccsd_program.html#expectation-"
"values>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Coupled-cluster, CCSD"
msgstr "耦合簇，CCSD"

msgid ""
"The command ``CCSD`` performs a closed-shell coupled-cluster calculation. "
"Using the ``CCSD(T)`` command, the perturbative contributions of connected "
"triple excitations are also computed."
msgstr "命令 ``CCSD`` 执行闭壳层耦合簇计算。使用 ``CCSD(T)`` 命令时，还会计算关联三重激发的微扰贡献。"

msgid ""
"If the CCSD is not converged, an error exit will occur if triples are "
"requested. This can be avoided using the ``NOCHECK`` option:"
msgstr "如果 CCSD 未收敛，而请求计算三重激发，则会发生错误退出。可以使用 ``NOCHECK`` 选项避免此情况："

msgid "``CCSD(T),NOCHECK``"
msgstr "``CCSD(T),NOCHECK``"

msgid ""
"In this case the (T) correction will be computed even if the CCSD did not "
"converge. Note: ``NOCHECK`` has no effect in geometry optimizations or "
"frequency calculations."
msgstr "在这种情况下，即使 CCSD 未收敛，也会计算 (T) 校正。注意：\\ ``NOCHECK`` 在几何优化或频率计算中无效。"

msgid "For further information on triples corrections see under RCCSD."
msgstr "关于三重激发校正的更多信息，请参见 RCCSD 部分。"

msgid ""
"In cases that the Hartree-Fock reference determinant does not sufficiently "
"dominate the wavefunction, the program will stop with a message "
"``UNREASONABLE NORM. CALCULATION STOPPED``. This can be avoided by setting "
"the option ``CC_NORM_MAX``\\ =\\ *value* on the CCSD command line. The "
"calculation is stopped if the square norm of the wavefunction (in "
"intermediate normalization) exceeds ``1+nval*CC_NORM_MAX``, where nval is "
"the number of correlated valence orbitals. The default value is "
"``CC_NORM_MAX=0.2``."
msgstr ""
"如果 Hartree-Fock 参考行列式不能充分主导波函数，程序将停止并显示消息 ``UNREASONABLE NORM. CALCULATION "
"STOPPED``\\ 。可以通过在 CCSD 命令行上设置选项 ``CC_NORM_MAX``\\ =\\ *值* "
"来避免此情况。如果波函数的平方范数（在中间归一化下）超过 ``1+nval*CC_NORM_MAX``\\ ，则计算停止，其中 nval "
"是关联价层轨道的数量。默认值为 ``CC_NORM_MAX=0.2``\\ 。"

msgid "Quadratic configuration interaction, QCI"
msgstr "二次组态相互作用，QCI"

msgid ""
"``QCI`` or ``QCISD`` performs quadratic configuration interaction, QCISD. "
"Using the ``QCI(T)`` or ``QCISD(T)`` commands, the contributions of "
"connected triples are also computed by perturbation theory. Normally, no "
"further input is needed if the ``QCI`` card follows the corresponding HF-"
"SCF. Otherwise, occupancies and orbitals can be specified as in the CI "
"program. For modifying DIIS directives, see section `the DIIS directive "
"<the_closed_shell_ccsd_program.html#the-diis-directive>`__."
msgstr ""
"``QCI`` 或 ``QCISD`` 执行二次组态相互作用，QCISD。使用 ``QCI(T)`` 或 ``QCISD(T)`` "
"命令时，关联三重组态的贡献也通过微扰理论计算。通常，如果 ``QCI`` 卡片跟在相应的 HF-SCF 之后，则不需要进一步的输入。否则，可以像在 CI"
" 程序中那样指定占据数和轨道。关于修改 DIIS 指令，请参阅章节 `the DIIS directive "
"<the_closed_shell_ccsd_program.html#the-diis-directive>`__\\ 。"

msgid "For avoiding error exits in case of no convergence, see ``CCSD(T)``."
msgstr "为避免不收敛时出现错误退出，请参阅 ``CCSD(T)``\\ 。"

msgid "Brueckner coupled-cluster calculations, BCCD"
msgstr "Brueckner 耦合簇计算，BCCD"

msgid "In addition, the same options as for CCSD can be used."
msgstr "此外，可以使用与 CCSD 相同的选项。"

msgid ""
"The Brueckner orbitals and approximate density matrix can be saved on a "
"``MOLPRO`` dump record using the ``SAVEORB`` option. The orbitals are "
"printed if the ``PRINT`` option is given. ``TYPE`` can be used to specify "
"the type of the approximate density to be computed:"
msgstr ""
"Brueckner 轨道和近似密度矩阵可以使用 ``SAVEORB`` 选项保存在 ``MOLPRO`` 转储记录上。如果给出 ``PRINT`` "
"选项，则会打印轨道。\\ ``TYPE`` 可用于指定要计算的近似密度类型："

msgid ""
"``TYPE=REF`` Compute and store density of reference determinant only "
"(default). This corresponds to the BOX (Brueckner orbital expectation value)"
" method of `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S0009-2614(99)01251-8>`__ **315**, 248 (1999)."
msgstr ""
"``TYPE=REF`` 仅计算并存储参考行列式的密度（默认）。这对应于 `Chem. Phys. Lett. "
"<https://dx.doi.org/10.1016/S0009-2614(99)01251-8>`__ **315**, 248 (1999) 中的"
" BOX（Brueckner 轨道期望值）方法。"

msgid ""
"``TYPE=TOT`` Compute and store density with contribution of pair amplitudes "
"(linear terms). Normally, this does not seem to lead to an improvement."
msgstr "``TYPE=TOT`` 计算并存储包含对振幅贡献（线性项）的密度。通常，这似乎不会带来改进。"

msgid "``TYPE=ALL`` Compute and store both densities"
msgstr "``TYPE=ALL`` 计算并存储两种密度"

msgid ""
"Note: The expectation variables are stored in variables as usual. In the "
"case that both densities are made, the variables contain two values, the "
"first corresponding to ``REF`` and the second to ``TOT`` (e.g., DMZ(1) and "
"DMZ(2)). If ``TYPE=REF`` or ``TYPE=TOT`` is give, only the corresponding "
"values are stored."
msgstr ""
"注意：期望值变量照常存储在变量中。如果生成了两种密度，则变量包含两个值，第一个对应 ``REF``\\ ，第二个对应 ``TOT``\\ "
"（例如，DMZ(1) 和 DMZ(2)）。如果指定了 ``TYPE=REF`` 或 ``TYPE=TOT``\\ ，则仅存储相应的值。"

msgid "The BRUECKNER directive"
msgstr "BRUECKNER 指令"

msgid ""
"This directive allows the modification of options for Brueckner "
"calculations. Normally, none of the options has to be specified, and the "
"``BCCD`` command can be used to perform a Brueckner CCD calculation."
msgstr ""
"此指令允许修改 Brueckner 计算的选项。通常，无需指定任何选项，并且可以使用 ``BCCD`` 命令执行 Brueckner CCD 计算。"

msgid "Singles-doubles configuration interaction, CISD"
msgstr "单-双激发组态相互作用，CISD"

msgid ""
"Performs closed-shell configuration interaction, CISD. The same results as "
"with the CI program are obtained, but this code is somewhat faster. "
"Normally, no further input is needed. For specifying DIIS directives, see "
"section `the DIIS directive <the_closed_shell_ccsd_program.html#the-diis-"
"directive>`__"
msgstr ""
"执行闭壳层组态相互作用，CISD。与使用 CI 程序获得的结果相同，但此代码速度稍快。通常，无需进一步输入。关于指定 DIIS 指令，请参阅章节 "
"`the DIIS directive <the_closed_shell_ccsd_program.html#the-diis-"
"directive>`__"

msgid "Quasi-variational coupled cluster, QVCCD"
msgstr "准变分耦合簇，QVCCD"

msgid ""
"Performs closed-shell quasi-variational coupled cluster, QVCCD Normally the "
"effect of single excitations needs to be included through orbital "
"optimisation, and this can be done either through the Brueckner condition "
"(``BQVCCD``), or through variational minimisation of the energy functional "
"with respect to orbital rotations (``OQVCCD``)."
msgstr ""
"执行闭壳层准变分耦合簇，QVCCD。通常，单激发的效应需要通过轨道优化来包含，这可以通过 Brueckner 条件（\\ ``BQVCCD``\\ "
"）或通过能量泛函相对于轨道旋转的变分最小化（\\ ``OQVCCD``\\ ）来实现。"

msgid "Distinguishable cluster, DCD"
msgstr "可区分簇, DCD"

msgid "The DIIS directive"
msgstr "DIIS 指令"

msgid "[sec:ccdiis]"
msgstr "[sec:ccdiis]"

msgid ""
"This directive allows to modify the DIIS parameters for CCSD, QCISD, or BCCD"
" calculations."
msgstr "此指令允许修改 CCSD、QCISD 或 BCCD 计算的 DIIS 参数。"

msgid ""
"In addition, there is a threshold *THRDIS* which may be modified with the "
"``THRESH`` directive. DIIS extrapolation is only done if the variance is "
"smaller than *THRDIS*."
msgstr ""
"此外，还有一个阈值 *THRDIS*\\ ，可通过 ``THRESH`` 指令修改。仅当方差小于 *THRDIS* 时，才执行 DIIS 外推。"

msgid "Saving the wavefunction"
msgstr "保存波函数"

msgid "Starting wavefunction"
msgstr "起始波函数"

msgid "Examples"
msgstr "示例"

msgid "Single-reference correlation treatments for H2O"
msgstr "H2O 的单参考关联处理"

msgid "Single-reference correlation treatments for N2F2"
msgstr "N2F2 的单参考关联处理"

msgid "This calculation produces the following table:"
msgstr "此计算产生以下表格："

msgid "Expectation values"
msgstr "期望值"

msgid ""
"One-electron properties in closed-shell QCISD, QCISD(T), CCD, CCSD, CCSD(T),"
" and DCSD can be computed by using ``EXPEC``. (the ``GEXPEC`` directive has "
"no effect in this case). The following options can be specified"
msgstr ""
"对于闭壳层 QCISD、QCISD(T)、CCD、CCSD、CCSD(T) 和 DCSD，可以使用 ``EXPEC`` 计算单电子性质。（在这种情况下 "
"``GEXPEC`` 指令无效）。可以指定以下选项"

msgid ""
"Note that, in CCSD, the orbital relaxation effect on properties is less "
"pronounced than, for example, in MP2. By default, only dipole moments are "
"computed. The syntax for operators *opname* is explained in section `One-"
"electron operators and expectation values (GEXPEC) "
"<program_control.html#one-electron-operators-and-expectation-values-"
"gexpec>`__. See also ``DM`` in section `saving the density matrix "
"<the_closed_shell_ccsd_program.html#saving-the-density-matrix>`__, and "
"``NATORB`` in section `natural orbitals "
"<the_closed_shell_ccsd_program.html#natural-orbitals>`__."
msgstr ""
"请注意，在CCSD中，轨道弛豫对性质的影响不如例如MP2中那么显著。默认情况下，仅计算偶极矩。算符 *opname* 的语法在章节 `One-"
"electron operators and expectation values (GEXPEC) "
"<program_control.html#one-electron-operators-and-expectation-values-"
"gexpec>`__ 中解释。另请参见章节 `saving the density matrix "
"<the_closed_shell_ccsd_program.html#saving-the-density-matrix>`__ 中的 "
"``DM``\\ ，以及章节 `natural orbitals "
"<the_closed_shell_ccsd_program.html#natural-orbitals>`__ 中的 ``NATORB``\\ 。"

msgid "Saving the density matrix"
msgstr "保存密度矩阵"

msgid ""
"The first-order density matrix in AO basis is stored in record *record* on "
"file *ifil*. For details, see section `saving the density matrix "
"<moller_plesset_perturbation_theory.html#saving-the-density-matrix>`__. See "
"also ``NATORB`` in section `natural orbitals "
"<the_closed_shell_ccsd_program.html#natural-orbitals>`__."
msgstr ""
"一阶密度矩阵以原子轨道基组形式存储在文件 *ifil* 的记录 *record* 中。详情请参见章节 `saving the density "
"matrix <moller_plesset_perturbation_theory.html#saving-the-density-"
"matrix>`__\\ 。另请参见章节 `natural orbitals "
"<the_closed_shell_ccsd_program.html#natural-orbitals>`__ 中的 ``NATORB``\\ 。"

msgid "Natural orbitals"
msgstr "自然轨道"

msgid ""
"Calculate natural orbitals. The options are the same as for MP2. For "
"details, see section `natural orbitals "
"<moller_plesset_perturbation_theory.html#natural-orbitals>`__."
msgstr ""
"计算自然轨道。选项与MP2相同。详情请参见章节 `natural orbitals "
"<moller_plesset_perturbation_theory.html#natural-orbitals>`__\\ 。"

msgid "Dual basis set calculations"
msgstr "双重基组计算"

msgid ""
"Dual basis set calculations are possible with the closed-shell MP2 and CCSD "
"codes (conventional and local, also with density fitting where available). "
"Normally this means that the Hartree-Fock calculation is done with a smaller"
" basis set than the correlation calculation. In MOLPRO, two possibilities "
"exist: the recommended one is to perform the HF and MP2 or CCSD calculations"
" using the same basis set, and only omit higher angular momentum functions "
"in the HF. This means that the resulting HF orbitals can be used directly in"
" the correlation calculation. Alternatively, one can use entirely different "
"basis sets in HF and the correlation calculation; in this case the orbitals "
"in the correlation calculation are determined by a least square fit to the "
"HF orbitals. This is less efficient (in particular in fully direct "
"calculations) and somewhat less accurate. In any case, a new Fock matrix is "
"computed in the MP2/CCSD program and block diagonalized in the occupied and "
"virtual orbital subspaces. A perturbative singles correction is applied in "
"the MP2 in order to reduce the HF basis set error."
msgstr ""
"双重基组计算可以在闭壳层 MP2 和 CCSD 代码（传统和局域版本，以及在可用时结合密度拟合）中进行。通常这意味着哈特里-"
"福克计算使用的基组比相关计算使用的基组更小。在 MOLPRO 中，存在两种可能性：推荐的方法是使用相同的基组执行 HF 和 MP2 或 CCSD "
"计算，仅在 HF 计算中省略更高角动量的函数。这意味着生成的 HF 轨道可以直接用于相关计算。或者，可以在 HF "
"和相关计算中使用完全不同的基组；在这种情况下，相关计算中的轨道通过最小二乘拟合 HF "
"轨道来确定。这种方法效率较低（特别是在完全直接计算中），并且精度稍差。无论如何，在 MP2/CCSD 程序中会计算一个新的 Fock "
"矩阵，并在占据轨道和虚轨道子空间中进行块对角化。在 MP2 中应用了微扰单激发修正，以减少 HF 基组误差。"

msgid "Typically, the input is as follows:"
msgstr "通常，输入如下所示："

msgid ""
"The option ``dual=1`` is required, otherwise the program will stop with an "
"error message saying that the basis set of the reference orbitals is "
"inconsistent. This is a precaution in order to avoid unexpected results."
msgstr "选项 ``dual=1`` 是必需的，否则程序将停止并报错，提示参考轨道的基组不一致。这是一种预防措施，以避免意外结果。"

msgid ""
"Similarly, this works for other closed-shell single reference methods such "
"as ``MP2, QCISD, MP2-F12, CCSD-F12``, and for the local variants ``LMP2, "
"LQCISD, LCCSD`` in either conventional or direct mode. Furthermore, dual "
"basis set ``DF-LMP2, DF-LCCSD, DF-LMP2-F12`` calculations are possible."
msgstr ""
"类似地，这适用于其他闭壳层单参考方法，例如 ``MP2, QCISD, MP2-F12, CCSD-F12``\\ ，以及传统或直接模式下的局域变体 "
"``LMP2, LQCISD, LCCSD``\\ 。此外，双重基组的 ``DF-LMP2, DF-LCCSD, DF-LMP2-F12`` "
"计算也是可能的。"
